	"data": "Spec Writing as a Skill\n\nType: Skill Development\nStatus: Active — first specs in progress\nStarted: 2026-09-04\n\nCore Idea\nLearning to write detailed technical specifications for AI-assisted implementation. Inspired by Dave Plummer (original Windows Task Manager developer) who wrote a 107-page specification for TMOG (Task Manager OG), a cross-platform rewrite implemented by Claude Code in 3.5 hours.\n\nThe Inspiration\nDave Plummer wrote Task Manager in 1994 at home. In 2026, he rewrote it as TMOG —…",
